cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software or its results, please cite it.
title: "SentinelAI: hybrid intrusion detection built around the analyst's budget"
abstract: >-
  A hybrid network intrusion detection platform combining an isolation forest,
  gradient-boosted trees and an authentication-graph detector, fused by an
  out-of-fold logistic stacker and evaluated under an explicit alert budget
  rather than by threshold-free ranking metrics alone. Includes Shapley
  attributions on every alert, a hash-chained SOAR audit log, and a persistence
  layer with append-only audit guarantees. Implemented in NumPy and the Python
  standard library with no third-party machine learning dependencies.
type: software
